      "title": "Vibration alarm",
      "text": "The vibration alarm setpoint shall be stated on the datasheet."
     },
     {
      "clause": "9.2",
      "title": "Reciprocating machines",
      "text": "A reciprocating compressor shall have a pulsation study."
